Output docs/assets/media/third-party-analysis.webm
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 18
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "bofbench analyze arsenal/trustedsec-sa/SA/whoami/whoami.x64.o"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "bofbench analyze arsenal/trustedsec-sa/SA/whoami/whoami.x64.o --compare arsenal/trustedsec-sa/SA/whoami/whoami.x86.o"
Enter
Sleep 7s
